1","priority":5,"questId":76502,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":765020101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7175,"speakerName":"Aino","textMapHash":146043114,"text":"#Hey, it's you, {NICKNAME}! And Paimon, too! Well? What's up? Need my genius for some super hyper mega commission?","nextNodeIds":[765020102]},{"nodeId":765020102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7175,"speakerName":"Aino","textMapHash":2214403682,"text":"Tell you what, I'll give you a twenty percent friend discount on my services! Just bring me snacks... Ooh yeah, and keep that secret from Ineffa!","nextNodeIds":[765020103,765020104]},{"nodeId":765020103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1332088882,"text":"We're just looking around.","nextNodeIds":[765020105]},{"nodeId":765020105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7175,"speakerName":"Aino","textMapHash":1690910306,"text":"Hehe, then this is the rightest spot of 'em all! My craftshop is one-hundred-ten-percent shiny-awesome-sauce by mass. You won't find better anywhere else, bet'cha bottom Mora!","nextNodeIds":[765020106]},{"nodeId":765020106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7175,"speakerName":"Aino","textMapHash":161502522,"text":"Just watch your step, or one component or another might send ya faceplantin' and stuff.","nextNodeIds":[765020107,765020108]},{"nodeId":765020107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3318464978,"text":"This robot looks pretty... unique.","nextNodeIds":[765020109]},{"nodeId":765020109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7175,"speakerName":"Aino","textMapHash":2947077794,"text":"Hehe! Whaddya think? Knuckle Duckle, this one's called. Designed it to sort trash and scrap metal.","nextNodeIds":[765020110]},{"nodeId":765020110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7175,"speakerName":"Aino","textMapHash":3391083138,"text":"But, ah, I built it too tough, and its cantilevers, mega agile. So I thought, \"Eh, why not give it super-dee-duper defenses to match?\"","nextNodeIds":[765020111]},{"nodeId":765020111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7175,"speakerName":"Aino","textMapHash":417627642,"text":"That way, it'll turn any baddies fixing to sneaky-beaky into my craftshop into non-recyclable garbage, easy!","nextNodeIds":[765020112]},{"nodeId":765020112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1843189730,"text":"Your ideas are as wild as ever, huh?","nextNodeIds":[765020113,765020114]},{"nodeId":765020113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":349955386,"text":"Well, since the opportunity's presenting itself...","nextNodeIds":[765020115]},{"nodeId":765020115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7175,"speakerName":"Aino","textMapHash":1913124834,"text":"M—Me? With Knuckle Duckle? W—Well, uh, people are usually into my inventions. Don't get photos of me taken nearly as often...","nextNodeIds":[765020116]},{"nodeId":765020116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7175,"speakerName":"Aino","textMapHash":1784343154,"text":"But if you wanna catch this whiz-kid and her bestest unbeatable battle bot in action using your Kamera, you can... Yeah, you can totally do that!","nextNodeIds":[765020117]},{"nodeId":765020117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7175,"speakerName":"Aino","textMapHash":2889560930,"text":"It's just... I don't usually take photos of myself, so I dunno much about looking cool and stuff... Not sure the pictures are gonna come out okay, y'know...","nextNodeIds":[765020118,765020119]},{"nodeId":765020118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":261326490,"text":"Just be yourself.","nextNodeIds":[765020120]},{"nodeId":765020120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7175,"speakerName":"Aino","textMapHash":833947818,"text":"Niiice! All you, then! Make sure to catch Knuckle Duckle at its awesomest too!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":765020119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":760934530,"text":"I'll make sure to hit the shutter when you're at your best!","nextNodeIds":[765020120]},{"nodeId":765020114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":997042914,"text":"Could we take a picture of you?","nextNodeIds":[765020115]},{"nodeId":765020108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3491019770,"text":"Is it one of yours?","nextNodeIds":[765020109]},{"nodeId":765020104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1209394314,"text":"And looking for some photo-op material while we're at it.","nextNodeIds":[765020105]}]},{"talkId":7650204,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["7650201","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["0","1","76502","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_QUEST_VAR_EQUAL"},{"param":["220122","1","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_PACK_HAVE_ITEM_WITH_ID"},{"param":["5285","5285006","1",